9-12 grid-4-12"><div class="block block-quote"><div class="has-icon left block-quote-figure"><div class="block-quote-image"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square shape-circle"><img alt="Michaela Bieliková" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="auto" src="/files/r/1280/michaela-bielikova.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/michaela-bielikova.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/michaela-bielikova.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/michaela-bielikova.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div><i class="icon icon-quote-right"></i><blockquote class="block-quote-text">Protel je pro CPI Hotels vynikající volba. Jeho intuitivní rozhraní, spolehlivost a efektivita nám umožňují snadno řídit rezervace, spravovat hosty a sledovat statistiky.</blockquote><div class="block-quote-author"><span class="quote-decor">–</span> Michaela Bieliková <span class="quote-decor">–</span><span class="block-quote-info">CPI Hotels, Director Of Training and Development</span></div></div></div></div></div>
